ut the Enrollee Type category that would be considered for the calculation of the premium rates.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Global Benefits</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="Holiday" EntityType="SFOData.Holiday" sap:label="Holiday" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>Holiday</Summary><LongDescription>This is a Holiday object that you can use to create holidays for inclusion in a holiday calendar. Holidays can be country-specific- for example, July 4 as Independence Day in the United States.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="BenefitEnrollmentDependencyConfiguration" EntityType="SFOData.BenefitEnrollmentDependencyConfiguration" sap:label="Manage Benefit Dependencies" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>BenefitEnrollmentDependencyConfiguration</Summary><LongDescription>To capture the Benefit Dependency with Configuration Id, Comment and Dependency Configuration Details</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Global Benefits</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="WorkflowAllowedActionList" EntityType="SFOData.WorkflowAllowedActionList" sap:label="WorkflowAllowedActionList" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>WorkflowAllowedActionList</Summary><LongDescription>Contains the list of workflow actions that the given employee is allowed based on their role.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Workflow</sap:tag><sap:tag>Results List Not Supported</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Doc